abstract: "Research and teaching use only. Two single-file offline browser applications with the version 1.0 interface: AMR-LEARN (a colony-image teaching tool with a ResNet-18 research model trained on the Jilin colony-image set) and AMR-WATCH (a surveillance teaching tool on synthetic data). Detector, rule and model code is unchanged from the validated builds (AMR-LEARN 0.21.0, AMR-WATCH 0.23.0). The frozen validation package and the scripts and result files behind the two papers are in Zenodo release v1.0.0 (10.5281/zenodo.23926262). No patient data. Not for clinical use."
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - colony images
  - surveillance
  - teaching
